":"新垣衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m003-0221","start":221,"end":226,"surface":"魯仲連先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m003-0234","start":234,"end":235,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m003-0235","start":235,"end":237,"surface":"人臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論或未定指代保留，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m003-0248","start":248,"end":253,"surface":"魯仲連先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m003-0255","start":255,"end":258,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m003-0261","start":261,"end":262,"surface":"勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m003-0269","start":269,"end":272,"surface":"新垣衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004662","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p004","text":"魯連見新垣衍而無言。新垣衍曰：「吾視居此圍城之中者，皆有求於平原君者也；今吾觀先生之玉貌，非有求於平原君者也，曷為久居此圍城之中而不去？」魯仲連曰：「世以鮑焦為無從頌而死者，皆非也。眾人不知，則為一身。彼秦者，棄禮義而上首功之國也，權使其士，虜使其民。彼即肆然而為帝，過而為政於天下，則連有蹈東海而死耳，吾不忍為之民也。所為見將軍者，欲以助趙也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"新垣衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"新垣衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0018","start":18,"end":25,"surface":"居此圍城之中者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論或未定指代保留，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"魯仲連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"鮑焦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"眾人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論或未定指代保留，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"其士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論或未定指代保留，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"其民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論或未定指代保留，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0143","start":143,"end":144,"surface":"連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m004-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004662","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p009","text":"於是平原君欲封魯連，魯連辭讓使者三，終不肯受。平原君乃置酒，酒酣起前，以千金為魯連壽。魯連笑曰：「所貴於天下之士者，為人排患釋難解紛亂而無取也。即有取者，是商賈之事也，而連不忍為也。」遂辭平原君而去，終身不復見。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、譬喻或未定指代；不依記憶補姓名與親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"魯連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"連","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m009-0094","start":94,"end":97,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004663","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-083","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou","source":{"title":"史記／卷083","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷083","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷083&oldid=2089252","revision_id":2089252,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"27段正文，自魯仲連者至太史公論贊；排除人物導覽、索隱述贊及現代版權。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"http